          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="11091667">WillowZilla</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP766 - Onoway&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was literally 30m from here on Friday! But ... somehow my phone wouldnt come on line and I'd forgotten to update BCP's past about 720 on my GPS ... so away I went. Fortunately, that was a camp dropoff, today was a camp pickup, so with a properly updated GPS I was able to quickly make a find today :)&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684400861">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP766 Onoway

Posted: N 53° 42.005 W 114° 11.905

MyGPSr: N 53° 42.006 W 114° 11.907&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deja vu or what? By that I mean I've been here before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;dronnord and I jumped out of the car during the last very snowy CARW 2017 event and kicked around gz for a bit attempting to find this one. With all the ice and snow the attempt was a bit half-hearted I admit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But today the story was different. On my way out to the &lt;a href="https://coord.info/GC7429V" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ranch II&lt;/a&gt; event I made the short detour to Onoway to make a proper find of this one. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
